/* AUTO-GENERATED by modules/themedesigner — hand edits here will be
   overwritten the next time backgrounds are regenerated. This theme's
   own background surfaces, one `.bg--{role}` block per Color System
   role this theme actually has (see modules/themedesigner). --bg-image
   is a placeholder for future gradient/image support, unused for now.
   --bg-color/--bg-light/--bg-dark/--bg-medium/--bg-accent/--bg-complement
   mirror the role's 6 stops so a component can reach for whichever one
   it needs instead of just the base fill. Each role's on-color pairing
   (--text-color/--link-color/etc, computed via ColorScheme) lives right
   alongside its fill here. */
.bg--primary {
